            wikitext: "== Usage ==\n* Shadow Step with [[gw:Aura of Displacement|Aura of Displacement]].\n* [[gw:Golden Phoenix Strike|Golden Phoenix Strike]] → [[gw:Horns of the Ox|Horns of the Ox]] → [[gw:Falling Lotus Strike|Falling Lotus Strike]] → [[gw:Twisting Fangs|Twisting Fangs]]\n* Use [[gw:Dash|Dash]] to keep up with kiting foes or to move between shrines. \n* Use [[gw:Signet of Malice|Signet of Malice]] after your chain or on foes already suffering from conditions to remove conditions.\n* while [[gw:Aura of Displacement|Aura of Displacement]] is recharging, precast [[gw:Shadow Refuge|Shadow Refuge]] for [[gw:Golden Phoenix Strike|Golden Phoenix Strike]].\n\n",
